  "openQuestions": [
    "Only 카테고리숫자코드 35001001 (첩약) lines are checked. 조제·탕전료 35002001, 심층변증방제기술료 35003001, 한약재 35001002, 시범사업약재 35004001 are not. Server should confirm the approval unit is the 첩약 line.",
    "LITE-only accounts (services exactly ['lite']) and non-face-to-face LITE order completion bypass the check entirely. Should the server keep these exemptions?",
    "The claim-side check C0005 (oBt) inspects only the first 35001001 line, while the completion check requires every line. Two pilot herbal lines in one encounter is probably rare but the rules differ.",
    "The treatment-screen realtime warning set (HFt in local.js) whitelists C0001/C0003 only, so C0005 from tBt is dropped there; the claim inbox shows C0005 from server-side data (ClaimV2InboxViewDangerAutoFix opens the '첩약 건보' submit tab). The authoritative C0005 source is presumably already the server.",
    "What sets 승인여부 = true is the HIRA submit flow (HiraSubmitItemsViewChubyakTable / desktop app). The server needs its own approval state source rather than trusting a client-sent flag."
  ]
